# Frontend
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.vite/
# frontend/dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it's committed so the app
# runs identically right after `git clone` on any machine, with no npm
# build step required just to view the UI. Rebuild it (`npm run build`)
# and commit the result whenever frontend source changes, or a clone will
# keep showing the last-committed build instead of your latest source.

